        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS44NBU, 4\" x 4\" Heavy Duty Grade Stainless Steel Hinge with Non-Removable Pin and 2 Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching Stainless Steel flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and #12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Available in Satin or Polished stainless finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, rust resistant,  Non-Removable stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS44U.jpg?v=1704354635\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS44NBU Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" Stainless Steel Hinge with Ball Bearings:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.129\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearings- 2BB</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS44NBUx-specification.pdf?v=1704262169\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS44NBU Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOnly 2 finishes are available for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>high quality solid Stainless Steel</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
